          "doc": "Used in Bidding, Dispatch and Settlements, only populated where Dual TLFs apply. For Bidding and Dispatch, the TLF for the generation component of a BDU, when null the TRANSMISSIONLOSSFACTOR is used for both the load and generation components. For Settlements, the secondary TLF is applied to all energy (load and generation) when the Net Energy Flow of the ConnectionPointID in the interval is positive (net generation).",
